+    """Matching key for a SKU: surrounding whitespace stripped, case folded.
+
+    ``casefold`` (not ``upper``/``lower``) is needed for full caseless
+    matching, e.g. "ẞ"/"ß"/"ss" or the Kelvin sign "K" vs "k". Uppercasing
+    first also folds the dotless "ı" together with "I"/"i", so that no two
+    keys share the same uppercase form in ``report``.
+    """
+    return sku.strip().upper().casefold()
 
 
